spans.s:
आ-√ ली Ā. -लीयते, to come close to;
to settle down upon;
to stoop, crouch, MBh.; Hariv.; Ragh. &c.

आ-√ लिख् P. -लिखति, to make a scratch on;
to delineate by scratches;
to scratch, ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; MBh.; Hariv. &c.;
to mark, draw, write, delineate, paint, MBh.; R.; Hariv.; VarBṛS.; Ragh.; Megh.; Mālav. &c.

आ-√ लिङ्ग् P. -लिङ्गति and -लिङ्गयति Ā. -लिङ्गते, to clasp, join the limbs closely;
to encircle, embrace, MBh.; Kathās.; Pañcat.; Ragh. &c.;
to spread out, extend, VarBṛS.

आ-√ लिह् P. -लिहति, to apply the tongue to;
to lick, lap, BhP. :
Intens. (p. -लेलिहान) to lick up (as fire), BhP. v, 6, 9.
